<title>USA: American Medserve unit makes acquisition.</title>
<headline>American Medserve unit makes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Medserve Corp said its Gatti LTC Services unit acquired Health Care Concepts Inc, of Greensburg, Pa., and related businesses.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Both companies are pharmacy services providers.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
